		(uuid "dd17a8a1-e364-57e8-800d-8f5fbcb1ec86")
	)
	(text "The TRS-80 Model I expansion edge (Level II; Tech Ref 26-2103 p.91) on a 40-wire IDC ribbon, header pin n = edge pin n.\nGrounds 8, 29, 37.  Pin 39 is +5V on keyboard boards A-E and GND on G: open.  RAS* CAS* MUX (the EI's DRAM timing) and\nTEST* (it floats the keyboard unit's buses) are open.  Every line meets one LVC buffer at the header (3.3 V, 5 V-tolerant\ninputs, Ioff) and a 100k pull-down (defined with the ribbon unplugged; to GND, so neither side back-feeds the other).\nThe strobes, SYSRES* and INTAK* through 74LVC3G17 Schmitt triggers.  D0-D7 IS the keyboard unit's data bus: the card\ndrives it only while RD* or IN* is low (OE* = DRIVE . RD* . IN*), through 75R.  GPIO map: m1_card.h (pico/trs80m1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 347.98 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3964eb2d-7598-5908-9c69-63693b87cc88")
	)
